b{"body":"> @gagb Would be great to have this as an example in the README! Thanks. \n\n _Originally posted by @sdhutchins in [#12](https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown/issues/12#issuecomment-2542522406)_\n\n\n```python\nfrom markitdown import MarkItDown\nfrom openai import OpenAI\n\nclient = OpenAI()\nmd = MarkItDown(mlm_client=client, mlm_model=\"gpt-4o\")\nimage_file = 'https://gagb.github.io/imgs/bansal-chi21.png'\nresult = md.convert(source=image_file)\nprint(result.text_content)\n```","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDONO81088AAAABzZOjBw","name":"documentation","description":"Improvements or additions to documentation","color":"0075ca"}],"number":15,"title":"Add model client example in docs/readme","url":"https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown/issues/15"}
